Portrait of a fantasy D&D character. A small male halfling (hobbit-like, 3 feet tall) with messy red hair and brown eyes that are always darting around. Permanent mischievous grin. Wearing a practical leather vest with too many pockets, soft boots. One hand is flipping a coin between his fingers. Youthful face, freckles. Rogue/thief archetype but likeable, not sinister. Background: cluttered alley with interesting objects. Style: realistic fantasy portrait, warm playful lighting, full body or waist-up.
